{"name": "Last Chickenburg", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of one of the Chickenfolk, trapped beneath the Humanfolk\u2019s endless tyranny. Break free from the chains of fate and rise as their leader - the Chicken King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first half of the story focuses on combat, exploration, and player growth. In the second half, you\u2019ll lead your people as the Chicken King: reclaim your homeland, build up your village, and hold the line against wave after wave of Humanfolk assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat takes center stage, paired with exploration. Along the way, you\u2019ll experience wilderness survival, hire mercenaries, put Chickenfolk to work, and defend your village. As a free-form, genre-bending ARPG, <strong>Last Chickenburg</strong> features a wide array of unique interactive mechanics waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/d268249215e710cad55ce5a74caf85b8.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat is stripped down to its purest form. Every weapon has just one move, so victory hinges on reading enemy tells and timing your strikes. You and your enemies play by the same rules - they may hunt for healing items and scoop up any equipment lying around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two battles never play out the same. A single move can play out completely differently depending on the terrain and how many fighters are in the fray. Master the rules, and you\u2019ll uncover new ways to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/4fdd570386cf6935ef7f8f507cfd5ba7.poster.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/4fdd570386cf6935ef7f8f507cfd5ba7.webm?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/4fdd570386cf6935ef7f8f507cfd5ba7.mp4?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/2531059fb96a30cef332597fd6bfc3a1.poster.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/2531059fb96a30cef332597fd6bfc3a1.webm?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/2531059fb96a30cef332597fd6bfc3a1.mp4?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/7b0ea0274438eae8b30233acf3aebe5a.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget what you know about traditional ARPGs. <strong>Last Chickenburg</strong> is full of clever interaction mechanics that deliver a fresh gameplay experience. One unified set of interaction rules applies to combat, exploration, and NPC encounters. Learn and master these systems, and you can bend the world to your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.poster.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.webm?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/0d052f8cd34e58ab869e333ee49c4c88.mp4?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.poster.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.webm?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/dc3022754daabfe46e09ceedd9db4079.mp4?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/00c739e755e8c07658747bb203d1c49a.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Later in the story, recruit mercenaries to join your journey, carry supplies, and fight alongside you. Capture strongholds, use houses to raise new Chickenfolk, and put your growing community to work forging weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanfolk raiding parties will keep coming for your villages. Turn what you\u2019ve produced into gear, arm your flock, and defend your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.poster.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.webm?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/be01a839a257ef9a5604b7e42e83c210.mp4?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.poster.avif?t=1792142783\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.webm?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/extras/a25e554d3d57c907e5523ae027a0c9e1.mp4?t=1792142783\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Last Chickenburg is an offbeat action RPG blending survival, strategy, and puzzle elements. Survive the Humanfolk\u2019s arena, rise as the Chicken King, and lead the Chickenkind to reclaim its homeland.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724930/08c00116a8972aef9e5cfa01dbe9b1ca6b846ac6/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1792142783", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action RPG", "Indie", "Early Access", "Combat", "Exploration", "Action"], "developers": "YerenGames", "publishers": "YerenGames", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "724930", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "16 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://y